\ safe-div.8th -- Thinking 8th, Chapter 5
\ Verified with: 8th code/ch05/safe-div.8th
\
\ A word with a genuinely variable stack effect: it returns different
\ numbers of things depending on what happened, documented with the
\ SED "|" (or) convention rather than picking one outcome to document.

: safe-div  \ n1 n2 -- n1/n2 true | false
  dup 0 n:= if
    drop drop false
  else
    n:/ true
  then ;

10 2 safe-div . cr . cr    \ => true, then 5
10 0 safe-div . cr         \ => false

bye
